DESCRIPTION:Lancaster Bicycle Club (LBC) Meetup\n**RIDE LEADER: Ann Morris
 **\n**SWEEP:** Jon Hartung\n**Cue and Ride with GPS link:**\n[https://rout
 es.lancasterbikeclub.net/cue/cv-new-holland-airport-3-43f/](https://routes
 .lancasterbikeclub.net/cue/cv-new-holland-airport-3-43f/)\n\n**Be Safe\, H
 ave Fun\, and Ride Together**\n\n**43 miles\, flat\, less than 1500 feet e
 levation gain. The ride leader will ride at the advertised pace of approx.
  12-14mph on average. The front 25 miles has food/snack/water stops availa
 ble. Sheetz\, Speedway\, Stauffer's (Grocery)\, Shoppes at Kissel Hill**\n
 **(Starbucks\, McDonalds\, etc.). Last half no identified food/water stops
 . Some riders may ride faster than the leader\, so we'll likely break into
  one or more smaller groups with stops to regroup periodically. Please sta
 y with other riders in your pace group so everyone has someone to ride wit
 h and nobody is riding solo.**\n\n**Helmets are mandatory. No earbuds. Ple
 ase bring water and a basic repair kit (spare tube\, tire levers\, pump/CO
 2 inflator).**\n\n**To eliminate passing around a pen and paper waiver\, w
 e require LBC Club membership and Meetup RSVP below to join this ride. Bei
 ng on**\n**Meetup does not mean you are a club member. Join here** [Member
  Signup](https://www.lancasterbikeclub.net/content.aspx?page_id=60&club_id
 =257148)\n\n**Your RSVP is your agreement to abide by the club's Code of C
 onduct:** [Code of Conduct](https://www.lancasterbikeclub.net/content.aspx
 ?page_id=22&club_id=257148&module_id=323984)\n\n**Guidance if an incident 
 occurs:** [Incident Actions](https://lancasterbikeclub.net/content.aspx?pa
 ge_id=22&club_id=257148&module_id=326137)
